{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"jenny-agutter","name":"Jenny Agutter","birthDate":"1952-12-20","birthPlace":"Taunton, Somerset, England, UK","bio":"Jennifer Ann \"Jenny\" Agutter (born 20 December 1952) is an English film and television actress. She began her career as a child actress in the mid 1960s, starring in the BBC television series The Railway Children and the film adaptation of the same book, before moving on to adult roles and relocating to Hollywood.\n\nShe played Alex Price in An American Werewolf in London, Jessica 6 in Logan's Run, Joanne Simpson in Child's Play 2 and Jill Mason in Equus. Since the 1990s, she has worked in sound recording, and she is a patron of the Cystic Fibrosis Trust. After a break from acting she has appeared in several television series since 2000, including the British series Spooks and Call the Midwife.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:35:14+00:00","tmdbId":14464,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/14464","credits":[{"id":"avengers","title":"The Avengers","character":"World Security Council"},{"id":"cap-winter","title":"Captain America: The Winter Soldier","character":"Councilwoman Hawley"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/jenny-agutter.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Call the Midwife: Sisters in Arms","year":2026,"character":"Sister Julienne / Narrator (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/YCH3NPIVeJW9eK2JSnIwv5KEjY.jpg"},{"name":"Mary Anning and the Dinosaur Hunters","year":2024,"character":"Miss Philpott","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/joEsFJfmu3b5276UaJfHQ2g4ztH.jpg"},{"name":"The Railway Children Return","year":2022,"character":"Roberta 'Bobbie' Waterbury","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sbps2oKs5ixtNSQqEae3r4mBq7x.jpg"},{"name":"Paris Calligrammes","year":2020,"character":"Self - English Narrator","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ly7T4hwyt6EgdMvLSnhi4zamIvp.jpg"},{"name":"Sometimes A